"version": "1",
"text": "You are dressed for a comfortable evening at your vocal lesson, with layers that keep you warm in the cool office air without weighing you down. Your choice balances your X-shaped figure perfectly: the cropped top highlights your waist while the straight-leg trousers draw the eye vertically, making you look taller and leaner. The soft sand tones wrap around you gently, creating a seamless visual flow from head to toe.",
"how_to_wear": [
"The outer jacket lives just for the transition between the office and the venue—take it off once you arrive to reveal your clean, classic suit underneath."
],
