"about_items": [
{
"n": "#7·12",
"text": "This oversized blazer in warm sand offers a modern, structured silhouette that sits perfectly on your shoulders. Its clean lines and sharp lapels give you a polished look without feeling stiff, and the relaxed fit allows for comfortable movement throughout your lesson."
},
{
"n": "#22·33",
"text": "These wide-leg trousers in beige provide a smooth, continuous line that elongates your legs. Their straight cut balances the volume of the jacket above, creating an effortless flow from waist to ankle."
},
{
"n": "#28·15",
"text": "The light beige suede loafers offer soft comfort and understated elegance. Their slip-on design ensures you can focus on your singing rather than adjusting your footwear."
},
{
"n": "#35·39",
"text": "This mosaic crossbody bag in green adds a vibrant pop of color against your neutral palette. Its geometric pattern brings playful energy to the outfit, while the adjustable strap keeps hands free for instruments or notes."
},
{
"n": "#267·29",
"text": "The belted parka in sand serves as a transitional layer—its wide sleeves and drawstring waist allow it to be worn comfortably over your suit when needed. The belt defines your waistline even while layered, maintaining the outfit’s shape."
}
]
}
